# Ruby 4.0.7 ships json 2.18.0 as a default gem in the base image. It stays on
# disk but is never loaded: Bundler activates the json locked in Gemfile.lock,
# and the Docker job fails if the loaded version differs from the locked one.
CVE-2026-33210

# Thruster 0.1.27, the latest release, is built with Go 1.27.1 and
# golang.org/x/net 0.59.0; the fixes are in Go 1.27.2 and x/net 0.60.0. In
# production Thruster listens on plain HTTP behind the platform proxy, which
# terminates TLS, so the TLS finding has no path in; the other two are denial
# of service on a free demo instance. Each entry expires so the image job fails
# again if no fixed Thruster has shipped by then.
CVE-2026-97031 exp:2026-11-14
CVE-2026-78669 exp:2026-11-14
CVE-2026-78667 exp:2026-11-14
